    "title": "Dailyhunt Xpresso News Cricket",
    "description": "- New Feature: Introducing <b>Xpresso news & videos on Dailyhunt</b>. News that matters in time that matters. Xpresso\u2019s available in Hindi & English, coming soon to all languages.\r\n\r\n- Just read news at a glance with <b>images & videos on Xpresso</b> in a visual and fun way\r\n\r\n- Dailyhunt, app for News & Videos \u2013 <b>Local, National & International News,\r\nPolitics, Entertainment, Cricket & much more!</b>\r\n\r\n- News, videos & viral cards in <b>English, \u0939\u093f\u0902\u0926\u0940, \u0ba4\u0bae\u0bbf\u0bb4\u0bcd, \u0c24\u0c46\u0c32\u0c41\u0c17\u0c41, \u0c95\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0ca1,\r\n\u0d2e\u0d32\u0d2f\u0d3e\u0d33\u0d02, \u092e\u0930\u093e\u0920\u0940, \u09ac\u09be\u0982\u09b2\u09be, \u0a97\u0ac1\u0a9c\u0ab0\u0abe\u0aa4\u0ac0, \u0b13\u0b21\u0b3f\u0b06, \u0a2a\u0a70\u0a1c\u0a3e\u0a2c\u0a40, \u0627\u0631\u062f\u0648, \u092d\u094b\u091c\u092a\u0941\u0930\u0940 & \u0985\u09b8\u09ae\u09c0\u09df\u09be</b>\r\n\r\n- Get <b>Personalized News feed</b> which is tailored for you based on your likes and dislikes. Read & Watch news articles on the topics that interest you and from the newspaper/TV channels you like.\r\n\r\n- Dailyhunt covers news from diverse genres - <b>Politics, Entertainment, Sports, Business, Weather, Astrology, Finance, Technology, Fashion, Beauty, Health & Fitness & more.</b>\r\n\r\n- Read news from <b>5000+ trusted Publishers</b> - Dailyhunt brings detailed news coverage from a variety of top publishers in your language and you get the news as it happens\r\n\r\n- Get <b>Instant Notification Alerts</b> - With Dailyhunt, be the first one to get notification on any breaking news or local update. Get Personalized notifications on topics of your choice & never miss out on any news in your city.\r\n\r\n- National & International news - Get latest breaking news alerts from our trusted global networks and stay updated on latest happenings and global current affairs\r\n\r\n- Get real time updates on all kinds of local news - <b>crime, accidents, water shortage, electricity cuts, road construction, traffic jams, mandi rates etc.<.b>\r\n\r\nFollow <b>Cricket T20 Updates</b> \r\n- All New Cricket Experience with Live Score Updates, Highlights, Commentary of the cricket matches\r\n- Expert opinions, in depth analysis, team news\r\n- Exclusive ball by ball commentary for Cricket World Cup\r\n\r\nRead News from your <b>favorite local newspapers (\u0905\u0959\u092c\u093e\u0930) & watch Videos (\u0935\u0940\u0921\u093f\u092f\u094b)</b>\r\n- Hindi \u2013 Live Hindustan, Aaj Tak, Amar Ujala,BBC Hindi, News18, ABP\r\nNews, India News, Jagran , BQ prime hindi\r\n- Tamil \u2013 Dinamalar, Dinakaran, Dinamani, Vikatan, The Hindu Tamil,\r\nPuthiya Thalaimurai, Polimer TV, News7 Tamil\r\n- Malayalam \u2013 Asianet, Mangalam, 24 News, Reporter, Madhyamam, Deepika, Kairali news, Deshabhimani\r\n- Kannada \u2013 Prajavani, Vijayavani, Kannada Dunia, Kannada Prabha, Udayavani, Suvarnanews, Varthabharathi, Vistara News, Hosadigantha\r\n- Telugu \u2013 Sakshi, Eenadu , Asianet, ABP Desam , News18, V6 News, NTV Telugu, Andhrajyothy, TV9 Telugu.\r\n- English \u2013 Hindustan Times, IndiaToday, The Indian Express, The New Indian Express, Deccan  Chronicle, Deccan Herald, The Telegraph, \r\nNews18,CNBCTV18 , The Hindu, Live Mint, BQ prime\r\n- Marathi \u2013 Lokmat, Sakal, Loksatta, Pudhari, Saamana, Saam TV, ABP Majha, News18 Lokmat, Zee News, Tv9 Marathi\r\n- Bangla \u2013 Calcutta News, Tara News, Tara TV, ABP Ananda, AnandaBazar, Patrika, Sangbad Pratidin, Jagaran Tripura, Aajkaal, CTVN, Syandan, Patrika, Kolkata TV\r\n- Gujarati \u2013 Gujarat Samachar, Sandesh, GSTV,  Zee News , Gujarati, ABP Asmita, News18 Gujarati , VTv Gujarati\r\n- Odia \u2013The Samaja, Sambad, Odisha Bhaskar, Orissa Reporter, OTV Khabar, Prameya, News 7, Nandighosa TV, Kanak News, Kalinga TV\r\n- Punjabi \u2013 Ajit Jalandhar, Jagbani, Rozana Spokesman,PTC News, ABP Sanjha\r\n- Assamese -Time 8, Asomiya Pratidin, North East Now, East Mojo\r\n\r\nREACH US: Report any issues or share feedback on how we can improve Dailyhunt. Please email us at: YourFriends@dailyhunt.in</b>",
